 ### Inputs and Outputs
 **Inputs:**
-*   Camera view frustum parameters (near/far planes, projection matrix) [S1, unofficial].
-*   Scene lighting data (directional light direction/color, point/spot lights, sky ambient) [S1, unofficial].
-*   Fog parameters (base density, height falloff, ground height, wind vector, noise scale) [S1, unofficial].
-*   Prebaked 3D noise texture (128x128x128 tileable) [S1, unofficial].
-*   Previous frame's froxel history (for temporal reprojection) [S1, unofficial].
+*   Camera parameters: Near/Far planes, View/Projection matrices, Screen resolution.
+*   Scene data: Opaque depth buffer, Shadow maps (or light atlas), Light positions/colors, Sky ambient.
+*   Fog parameters: Base density, height falloff, anisotropy ($g$), max distance, noise texture.
+*   History: Previous frame's froxel volume (for temporal reprojection).
 
 **Outputs:**
-*   Integrated froxel volume (RGB: accumulated in-scattered radiance; Alpha: remaining transmittance) [S1, unofficial].
-*   Composite result: Fogged scene color, optionally written back to `_CameraOpaqueTexture` for refractive materials [S1, unofficial].
+*   Integrated froxel volume: A 3D texture storing accumulated in-scattered radiance (RGB) and remaining transmittance (Alpha) [S3, unofficial].
+*   Final image: Scene color composited with the integrated fog volume.
 
 ### Data Structures
 
